@startuml state_machine_011_machine_interaction
' ============================================================
' Title:     State Machine 011 — Machine Interaction Overview
' Source:    docs/spec/contracts/ (all machines) · handoffs only
' C4:        api | application peers | ResolveConflict (domain) | certification_tool (offline)
' Package:   cross-machine handoffs only
' Contract:  1.3.0
' Role:      Cross-machine handoff overview (behavior only; C4 owns structure)
' ============================================================

!include ./common/state_styles.puml
!include ./common/state_identities.puml

title **State Machine 011 — Machine Interaction Overview**\nC4: api | application peers | ResolveConflict (domain) | certification_tool (offline)\n<size:12><i>authorization → domain machines · compile · inspect · findings · certification · artifacts</i></size>

' Colors follow C4 peer family (see state_styles.puml palette)
state "State Machine 007\nCapability Authorization" as Authorization $STATE_COLOR_GATE : C4: api (gate)\ningress · capability matrix ·\nsegregation of duties · stage\nallow | deny + audit
state "State Machine 002\nDirective Lifecycle" as DirectiveLifecycle $STATE_COLOR_RESOURCE : C4: directives_application\nDraft · Active · Deprecated · Superseded
state "State Machine 003\nCompilation Pipeline" as Compilation $STATE_COLOR_PENDING : C4: compilation_application (hermetic)\nhermetic gates · content-addressed publish
state "State Machine 010\nCompiled Rules Hash" as CompiledRulesHash $STATE_COLOR_PROCESS : C4: compilation_application\ndual-hash · reuse (detail of 003)
state "State Machine 004\nInspection Pipeline" as Inspection $STATE_COLOR_PROCESS : C4: inspections_application\nsix pure stages · FindingOpenPort
state "State Machine 001\nFinding Lifecycle" as FindingLifecycle $STATE_COLOR_RESOURCE : C4: findings_application\n**normative** · eleven states ·\nsegregation of duties
state "State Machine 009\nHybrid Logical Clock" as HybridLogicalClock $STATE_COLOR_RESOURCE : C4: finding_events_repository\n(pt, logical_counter, node_id) advance
state "State Machine 005\nConflict Resolution" as ConflictResolution $STATE_COLOR_DOMAIN : package: conflicts_domain\nResolveConflict (not C4 peer)
state "State Machine 006\nArchitectural Certification" as Certification $STATE_COLOR_EXTERNAL : non-peer: certification_tool\narchitectural audit gates 01…09 · offline
state "State Machine 008\nArtifact Lifecycle" as ArtifactLifecycle $STATE_COLOR_STORE : C4: artifacts_repository\nwrite-once · four kinds

[*] --> Authorization : <b>MutatingRequestReceived</b>
Authorization --> DirectiveLifecycle : <b>AuthorizationAllowedDirective</b>\n[capability directive.*]
Authorization --> Inspection : <b>AuthorizationAllowedInspection</b>\n[capability inspection.*]
Authorization --> FindingLifecycle : <b>AuthorizationAllowedFinding</b>\n[capability finding.* | evidence.*]
Authorization --> ConflictResolution : <b>AuthorizationAllowedConflict</b>\n[capability conflict.resolve]
Authorization --> [*] : <b>AuthorizationDenied</b>\nDomainUnchanged

DirectiveLifecycle --> Compilation : <b>CompileRequested</b>\npublish / identity operation
Compilation --> CompiledRulesHash : <b>HashDetailEntered</b>
CompiledRulesHash --> Compilation : <b>HashDetailReturned</b>\nsnapshot hash ready
Compilation --> ArtifactLifecycle : <b>CompiledRulesPublished</b>
DirectiveLifecycle --> ArtifactLifecycle : <b>DirectiveRecorded</b>

Inspection --> Compilation : <b>CompiledRulesPinned</b>\npin compiled_rules_snapshot_hash
Inspection --> FindingLifecycle : <b>FindingsBirthed</b>\nFindingCreated on Report
Inspection --> ArtifactLifecycle : <b>InspectionArtifactPublished</b>\nsnapshot + trace
Inspection --> ConflictResolution : <b>ConflictDetected</b>\nmulti-rule fire on frozen compiled rules

FindingLifecycle --> HybridLogicalClock : <b>FindingEventAppended</b>\nevery success event
HybridLogicalClock --> FindingLifecycle : <b>HybridLogicalClockTagged</b>\ntag logical clock
FindingLifecycle --> ArtifactLifecycle : <b>FindingEventAppended</b>\nappend finding_events_store

ConflictResolution --> ArtifactLifecycle : <b>ConflictArtifactPublished</b>
Compilation --> ConflictResolution : <b>ConflictDetected</b>\ncompile-time conflict map

Certification --> ArtifactLifecycle : <b>CertificationArtifactPublished</b>
Certification --> Compilation : <b>CertificationSamplesRead</b>\nread compiled rules samples
Certification --> FindingLifecycle : <b>CertificationSamplesRead</b>\nsegregation of duties / mediated-feedback tests\n(no production mutation)

ArtifactLifecycle --> [*] : <b>ArtifactRetained</b>\narchived / retained

footer State Machine 011 · Contract 1.1.0 · machine interaction overview · Selma

@enduml
